WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.017 --> 00:00:01.538
- Good afternoon.

00:00:01.618 --> 00:00:04.381
As many of us prepare to
travel home for the holidays,

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:06.742
we have the opportunity
to see some friends

00:00:06.742 --> 00:00:08.927
that we haven't spoken
with for quite some time.

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:11.190
- It's a time for
reminiscing and remembering,

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.739
sitting down and catching up.

00:00:12.739 --> 00:00:13.823
When we leave our home towns,

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:15.116
it's important to figure out

00:00:15.116 --> 00:00:16.914
what we should do on Facebook to catch up.

00:00:17.044 --> 00:00:17.905
Nothing.

00:00:17.915 --> 00:00:19.906
(whooshing and squeaking)

00:00:20.123 --> 00:00:22.993
It was fun seeing you guys,
but we don't need to pretend

00:00:22.993 --> 00:00:24.977
like we're gonna stay
in touch on Facebook.

00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:26.416
- John, I know you're happy to hear

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:27.547
that my parents are doing well.

00:00:27.547 --> 00:00:28.758
You told me in person.

00:00:28.758 --> 00:00:29.806
There is no reason for you

00:00:29.806 --> 00:00:31.635
to tell me again on my Facebook wall.

00:00:31.815 --> 00:00:33.870
- Hank, no, I haven't seen Jake.

00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:37.459
I don't know why you think
I'm the authority on Jake.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.283
We all graduated and went
to different schools.

00:00:39.283 --> 00:00:41.907
- Katie, we dated in high school, okay?

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:43.257
There's no need for you to pretend

00:00:43.257 --> 00:00:44.817
that you're happy that
I have a girlfriend.

00:00:45.185 --> 00:00:47.385
Also, those double dates
you keep posting about,

00:00:47.385 --> 00:00:48.885
they're never gonna happen.

00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:50.876
But I am happy you found Mitch, though.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:52.643
Seems like a chill dude.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.968
- Dave, yes, Anchorman was a funny movie,

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.701
and I know it was a special moment for you

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.068
when we saw it for your birthday,

00:00:58.068 --> 00:01:01.620
but I stopped quoting it, like, years ago.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.731
Keep it off my profile.

00:01:03.731 --> 00:01:06.074
- Justin, yes that picture of us was cute,

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:07.557
but I have a bunch of BFFs.

00:01:07.557 --> 00:01:09.839
I can't just cling onto that third F

00:01:09.839 --> 00:01:11.451
for someone I basically only spent

00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:12.430
a couple summers with.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:14.207
- Wait, you have another BFF named Justin?

00:01:14.337 --> 00:01:15.218
- Yeah, I told you that, right?

00:01:15.218 --> 00:01:15.947
Justin Hendricks.

00:01:15.947 --> 00:01:17.896
We were, like, inseparable
during summer camp.

00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:18.745
- Oh.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.719
- That was a long time ago.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.264
- And that's incidentally our hashtag

00:01:21.264 --> 00:01:23.158
to raise awareness for who
you went to school with.

00:01:25.698 --> 00:01:26.972
- So when your friend from high school

00:01:26.972 --> 00:01:28.520
that you used to be really close with

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.314
tries to comment on your Facebook again,

00:01:30.314 --> 00:01:31.485
just kindly remind them--

00:01:33.806 --> 00:01:35.321
- Thank you, and happy holidays.

00:01:35.321 --> 00:01:38.247
- And it was good seeing
you, though, Katie.

00:01:40.288 --> 00:01:41.529
Tell Mitch I say, "Hey".

00:01:41.637 --> 00:01:43.548
(soothing music playing)

00:01:46.156 --> 00:01:48.319
(whooshing and squeaking)

